  "reference": "Job 38",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "38",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 38"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "38",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "answered Job out of the whirlwind, and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this that darkeneth counsel by words without knowledge?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gird up now thy loins like a man; for I will demand of thee, and answer thou me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where wast thou when I laid the foundations of the earth? declare, if thou hast understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who hath laid the measures thereof, if thou knowest? or who hath stretched the line upon it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whereupon are the foundations thereof fastened? or who laid the corner stone thereof;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the morning stars sang together, and all the sons of God shouted for joy?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "who",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shut up the sea with doors, when it brake forth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as if",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "it had issued out of the womb?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When I made the cloud the garment thereof, and thick darkness a swaddlingband for it,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And brake up for it my decreed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "place",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and set bars and doors,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And said, Hitherto shalt thou come, but no further: and here shall thy proud waves be stayed?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast thou commanded the morning since thy days;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "caused the dayspring to know his place;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That it might take hold of the ends of the earth, that the wicked might be shaken out of it?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is turned as clay",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the seal; and they stand as a garment.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And from the wicked their light is withholden, and the high arm shall be broken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast thou entered into the springs of the sea? or hast thou walked in the search of the depth?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have the gates of death been opened unto thee? or hast thou seen the doors of the shadow of death?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast thou perceived the breadth of the earth? declare if thou knowest it all.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the way",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "where",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "light dwelleth? and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "darkness, where",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the place thereof,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That thou shouldest take it to the bound thereof, and that thou shouldest know the paths",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the house thereof?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Knowest thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", because thou wast then born? or",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "because",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the number of thy days",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.38.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.38.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "great?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast thou entered into the treasures of the snow? or hast thou seen the treasures of the hail,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.38.22"
            ]
